# CatDex Design System Rules (Figma MCP)

Use these rules for every Figma → code (and code → Figma) task.  
**Figma:** [Cat-DEX-UI](https://www.figma.com/design/qIYWbKuvILi9hjSmT60rmn/Cat-DEX-UI) (`qIYWbKuvILi9hjSmT60rmn`) · APP `239:19` · DS component pages.

---

## 1. Token definitions

**Source of truth:** `src/theme/` via `useTheme()` from `@/theme`.

| File | Tokens |
|---|---|
| `src/theme/colors.ts` | Brand, surfaces, text, borders, status |
| `src/theme/typography.ts` | `display`…`label` + font families |
| `src/theme/spacing.ts` | 8pt grid only |
| `src/theme/radius.ts` | 8 / 16 / pill |
| `src/theme/shadow.ts` | `low` · `medium` · `floating` · `glow` |
| `src/theme/motion.ts` | Durations + press scales |
| `src/theme/icons.ts` | `iconSize` · `iconStroke` |
| `src/theme/gradients.ts` | `primary` · `xp` · etc. |
| `src/theme/themeOverrides.ts` | Theme Lab brand/shape presets |
| `src/theme/ThemeProvider.tsx` | Runtime theme assembly |

**Format:** TypeScript `as const` objects (no Style Dictionary / CSS vars in-app).  
**Runtime:** Theme Lab (`src/store/themeLab.ts`) can remint brand colors + radius via `applyBrandToColors` / `applyShapeToRadius`.

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme'
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, iconSize, iconStroke } = useTheme()
```

IMPORTANT:

- Never hardcode hex/rgba, font sizes, spacing, or radii
- Coat/rarity accents: `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only — never app chrome
- Do **not** copy styles from `ChatDex Mobile App UI/`

### Key token values

| Role | Token | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Brand | `colors.brand` | `#6A69F8` |
| Brand pressed | `colors.brandPressed` | `#5554E0` |
| Canvas | `colors.background` | `#F9F9FB` |
| Surface | `colors.surface` | `#FFFFFF` |
| Text | `colors.text` | `#15172B` |
| Spacing | `spacing[4]`…`[96]` | 4·8·16·24·32·40·48·56·64·80·96 |
| Radius surfaces | `radius.md` | `8` |
| Radius CTA | `radius.cta` | `16` |
| Icons | `iconSize.md` | `24` |

### Figma variables → code

| Figma | Code |
|---|---|
| `color/brand`, `color/primary` | `colors.brand` / `colors.primary` |
| `color/background` | `colors.background` |
| `color/surface` | `colors.surface` |
| `color/text*` | `colors.text*` |
| `spacing/*` | `spacing[n]` / `spacing.sm`… |
| `radius/*` | `radius.*` |
| `typography/*` | `<Text variant="…" />` |
| `elevation/*` | `shadow.low\|medium\|floating\|glow` |

