## 2. Component library

**Location:** `src/components/` · barrel: `src/components/index.ts`  
**Architecture:** folder per component (`Button/Button.tsx` + `index.ts`); domain folders `Auth/`, `maps/`, `missions/`, `profile/`, `Settings/`, `ThemeLab/`  
**Storybook:** none for the Expo app

### Prefer these primitives

```ts
import {
  Text, Button, TextInput, SearchInput,
  Card, PhotoCard, Badge, Chip, Avatar,
  ProgressBar, BottomSheet, EmptyState, Spinner, Skeleton,
  GlassIconButton, BrandLogo,
} from '@/components'
```

### Figma component → code + variants

| Figma set | Code | Variant map |
|---|---|---|
| **Button** | `Button` | `Type` → `variant`: Primary→`primary`, Secondary→`secondary`, Tertiary→`tertiary`, Ghost→`ghost`, Destructive→`destructive`. `State=Disabled`→`disabled`, `Loading`→`loading`. `Label`→`title` |
| **Icon Button** | `Button variant="icon"` / `GlassIconButton` | `State` → pressed/disabled via Pressable |
| **Input** | `TextInput` | Default/Focused/Filled → interaction; Error→`error`; Valid→`valid`; Disabled→`disabled`; Label/Placeholder props |
| **Chip** | `Chip` | Unselected / Selected→`selected` / Disabled→`disabled` |
| **Badge** | `Badge` | Default/Success/Warning/Accent → `variant` |
| **Card** | `Card` | Default/Pressed → optional `onPress` |
| **Avatar** | `Avatar` | Initials / Image |
| **Progress** | `ProgressBar` / `XPBar` | Value 0–100 → `progress` 0–1 |

New shared UI → `src/components/<Name>/` + export from `index.ts`.  
Screens → `app/` (Expo Router).

