## 7. Project structure

```
app/                 # Expo Router screens (auth, tabs, settings, scanner…)
src/theme/           # Design tokens (SoT)
src/components/      # UI library
src/layout/          # Shell / chrome helpers
src/store/           # Zustand
src/lib/             # Domain helpers (incl. catTheme)
assets/              # Static images / models
server/              # Vision API (separate)
ChatDex Mobile App UI/  # Figma/web REFERENCE ONLY — not RN SoT
```

Brand copy: **CatDex** — “Ton quartier. Tes chats.”  
Map: HUD in `MapExplorerHud` — no bottom `MainTabBar`.

---

## Figma MCP required flow

1. `get_design_context` for the exact node(s)
2. If truncated → `get_metadata`, then re-fetch needed nodes
3. `get_screenshot` for the variant being built
4. Only then implement / download assets
5. Map Tailwind/hex output → CatDex tokens + components
6. Validate against screenshot before done

## Anti-patterns

- Hardcoded colors/spacing or off-grid values
- Copying `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` styles into RN
- New Button/Input when a variant already exists
- Installing icon libraries for Figma SVGs
- Using legacy Figma Inter styles / `Test Primary` vars — prefer `color/*` + `typography/*`
